person, it was absolutely not worth the money. The service, timing, and experience did not match what was promised. I would not recommend this cruise to anyone looking for a fun and worthwhile experience.","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21zeWRVZzJlVEowVFdVdFFWaElRMlpxY0c1UU1sRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x58033550030806bc!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmsydUg2eTJ0TWUtQVhIQ2ZqcG5QMlE%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","images":[{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNnTEa9f1lZH5WhjE-n08Q_TFd_nwv3bte5VinpS6pzbFeZ8tkmCQZDOZz-PhSRopMqVCPMKupGYnsZXUkosqKefpIo290DhhfIVOln47s-A82G3I4RkqS2ss8p7239dCpLF4mbEbZ1oh4Z=k-no"}],"date":"6 months ago","date_iso8601":"2026-04-05T22:02:46+00:00"},{"username":"Amit Kumar","rating":1,"contributor_id":"117010975619215890048","user_review_count":7,"user_photo_count":0,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUI_qqQ7mC_rPgCi2hs8ClAzum1Bg65YT2LIPu6h86ZuDF82TFTAA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100","description":"Avoid. Cheap food, cheap drinks. The food quality, cleanliness and ambience was so bad that we decided to skip eating the dinner entirely. IMPORTANT: Check the cruise before you pay money, you’ll understand what I mean.","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GM2IzUTNaVkExWjFWdlRIWlhZblZqT1ZSb1RrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x58033550030806bc!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnF3b3Q3ZVA1Z1VvTHZXYnVjOVRoTkE%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","date":"2 months ago","date_iso8601":"2026-08-02T09:36:06+00:00"},{"username":"shaibaz khan","rating":1,"contributor_id":"108711295746555922449","user_review_count":1,"user_photo_count":0,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUjm2JMlIDZdB32Q9toI539gg9YDo5D3sIP4-Pm1zTyXr5XpPU=s120-c-rp-mo-br100","description":"Overall, this cruise was a very disappointing and poorly managed experience. The timing was completely unreliable — even though the departure was scheduled for 9:30, it didn’t actually leave until 10:30, and there was no proper explanation or communication regarding the delay.\n\nThe duration of the trip was also misleading. We were promised a 2.5-hour experience, but the cruise returned by 12:00, cutting the trip short and making it feel rushed and incomplete.\n\nAnother issue was the misleading claim that the cruise was sold out. In reality, there were only around 25 people onboard, which made the whole situation feel exaggerated and dishonest.\n\nThe entertainment failed to meet expectations as well. There were only two staff members attempting to engage the crowd, and the effort lacked energy and enthusiasm. The atmosphere remained dull throughout, with very little happening to keep guests entertained.\n\nFor ₹1000 per person, the experience was definitely not worth the cost. Poor planning, lack of transparency, and underwhelming entertainment made this a frustrating outing. I would not recommend it to anyone looking for an enjoyable and well-organized cruise experience.\n\nThere should have been an option to give zero or negative stars — the only reason this gets one star is because that’s the lowest rating available.","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSYVNHVlBTbFZUVTNScWIwNWxYelI1ZUdjNVFXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x58033550030806bc!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlRaSGVPSlVTU3Rqb05lXzR5eGc5QWc%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","date":"6 months ago","date_iso8601":"2026-04-05T22:12:59+00:00"},{"username":"ar solankzzz","rating":5,"contributor_id":"113310368631897120270","user_review_count":3,"user_photo_count":2,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXRUeSaq5cUQb9S_bIizw9g7wZBcXSGZspArV5mTHs-icZlsHU=s120-c-rp-mo-br100","description":"Cruises on the Mandovi cruise offer beautiful views of Panaji city, riverbanks, and sunset. Evening cruises especially have a relaxing vibe with great photo spots. 📸","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poaWJESkVjSG81W